{"id":"n24107-2-2","stage":2,"title":"이내 · 之后就","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n24107-2-2-1","ko":"어머니의 소식은 이내 모르는군.","zh":"还没听到关于你母亲的消息呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"어머니의","meaning":"母亲，妈妈","explanation":"어머니：母亲，妈妈；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"어머니","audio":"/audio/a8f7e3b1e379f4880b79.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74361","senseId":"2","lemma":"어머니","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어머니의","audio":"/audio/2b010f4ec95e129befff.mp3"}},{"text":"소식은","meaning":"消息","explanation":"소식：消息；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"소식","audio":"/audio/648fb8dfcf63ca8c8cb6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71143","senseId":"1","lemma":"소식","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"소식은","audio":"/audio/a00c2429d8dd99255c83.mp3"}},{"text":"이내","meaning":"一直、始终（持续至今）","explanation":"이내 在此采用“从某时起一直持续”的义项，与 모르는군 合起来表示一直不知道消息；不是常见的马上、立刻义。","readings":[{"term":"이내","audio":"/audio/a82c77e6b6f083bf4089.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24107","senseId":"2","lemma":"이내","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이내","audio":"/audio/a82c77e6b6f083bf4089.mp3"}},{"text":"모르는군.","meaning":"不知道，不认识，不懂","explanation":"모르다：不知道，不认识，不懂；는군：对新发现或刚得知的情况表示感叹，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"모르다","audio":"/audio/20ef19694f337fd42539.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29712","senseId":"1","lemma":"모르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"모르는군","audio":"/audio/f5b56c8f7f48e3233096.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"a8f7e3b1e379f488","term":"어머니","zh":"母亲，妈妈","audio":"/audio/a8f7e3b1e379f4880b79.mp3","entryId":"74361","definition":"在与子女有关的事情上用于指称或称呼有子女的女子。","pronunciation":["어머니"]},{"id":"648fb8dfcf63ca8c","term":"소식","zh":"消息","audio":"/audio/648fb8dfcf63ca8c8cb6.mp3","entryId":"71143","definition":"告知远方的人或不常见的人的情况或状况的话或文字。","pronunciation":["소식"]},{"id":"a82c77e6b6f083bf","term":"이내","zh":"从某时起一直、始终","audio":"/audio/a82c77e6b6f083bf4089.mp3","entryId":"24107","definition":"从某时起一直、始终","pronunciation":["이내"]},{"id":"20ef19694f337fd4","term":"모르다","zh":"不知道，不认识，不懂","audio":"/audio/20ef19694f337fd42539.mp3","entryId":"29712","definition":"不清楚或不了解人或事物、事实等。","pronunciation":["모ː르다"]}],"audio":"/audio/24dc996b6bb4f4b13588.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n24107-2-2-2","ko":"네. 어디 알 수가 있어야지요.","zh":"是啊，要怎么才能知道呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네.","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"네：是，行。","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17294","senseId":"2","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}},{"text":"어디","meaning":"怎么，哪里，哪能","explanation":"어디：怎么，哪里，哪能。","readings":[{"term":"어디","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60320","senseId":"2","lemma":"어디","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어디","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3"}},{"text":"알","meaning":"知道，明白","explanation":"알다：知道，明白；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"알다","audio":"/audio/4646a3463436c8a43feb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89445","senseId":"1","lemma":"알다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"알","audio":"/audio/63251c05b0dbf37fa9f0.mp3"}},{"text":"수가","meaning":"可以，可能","explanation":"수：可以，可能；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"수","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15615","senseId":"1","lemma":"수","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"수가","audio":"/audio/6780a417c9a853af476b.mp3"}},{"text":"있어야지요.","meaning":"能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）","explanation":"있다：能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）；어야지요：礼貌地表示应当、必要或决心；也可随语境构成反问。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"5","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있어야지요","audio":"/audio/3f032a2cfcf56ad1d9d3.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1c0ddfd005093840","term":"네","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3","entryId":"17294","definition":"用于肯定回答长辈所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["네"]},{"id":"c1ee1b7e560f9f3a","term":"어디","zh":"怎么，哪里，哪能","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3","entryId":"60320","definition":"用于反问的语气，意在强调。","pronunciation":["어디"]},{"id":"4646a3463436c8a4","term":"알다","zh":"知道，明白","audio":"/audio/4646a3463436c8a43feb.mp3","entryId":"89445","definition":"通过教育、经验、思考等来，具备与事物或情况相关的信息或知识。","pronunciation":["알ː다"]},{"id":"dcd19f5b5caac977","term":"수","zh":"可以，可能","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3","entryId":"15615","definition":"做某事的能力，或某事发生的可能性。","pronunciation":["수"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/2b26388155e24ecd758c.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":1.718,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=24107","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"중급","day":63,"sequenceScore":1.5447,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["是啊，要怎么才能知道呢。","还没听到关于你母亲的消息呢。","你有几个兄弟姐妹？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["还没听到关于你母亲的消息呢。","你有几个兄弟姐妹？","是啊，要怎么才能知道呢。"],"answer":2}]}
